+	/*
+	 * 3038: a dictionary. VideoToolbox (FigGetAlignmentForIOSurfaceOutputToDisplayService) and QuartzCore both look
+	 * PlaneBaseAlignmentLinear up in it; on a bare number mediaplaybackd aborted ("-[__NSCFNumber objectForKey:]") at
